{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1196,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cbf90fc15eb175db4717d3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微有点……害羞呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aaf2c5462be8d2c1011486630ebc601b2fd390d47a3dfe10cd93a0a0fc4b24c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638cea8b103c6851cdd5e1ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比任何人都快、比任何人都更靠前……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3f1356d90814ea43e5fe0fb1d5f798d177f9fcc7782c1a15d592e335a5a0f30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee53878c3c920773b223b5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然偶尔也会闹过头…但还是很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80d3b4f4b13f8e79a8b113d2f252bee4c21f3026d99ddaf03752ea76e4126291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383fee4ab5e6baecb1291190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要露出笑脸边唱边跳……Live，真难呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5427917510ecab35c9ff1a91b1912354678254744a47121f6ffce722328171b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c49365b288c89f83039baf71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "见识过各种各样的景色了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19cdc206d79f397a4d74682dfdcc490818ebf85a982ee4a4885f2788e865091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ca4eea8bb81a972625d8a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……非常凉快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b5c0ed699ab396491390853511d1d782cf81d535ca10ccd0e5ec2a73323163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b53349f76313b03a6382a4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像海洋的颜色一样，真棒呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d62850ff57a992a97f25b4d8f6780a340aafc0df8d3b7ad858463b3c9dfebee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfa4ba866508836a8012f7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "882c61f943b29ccffcc7cff6723ee11ec25d00aa5e2bbb7ac7cc7e52f7e2321b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5eb5dd2c3cf6c0fc104e314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最前方的景色，我绝不拱手相让……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f6391790f26c18f80ec087798462582dfa51058fb5c9ec48bcb3f8b59a6d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea666dc213b6bb15380bfe19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbe67242c64422e9203a4b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……\n请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e0b163e7184f65f79a532c3fae403eb0795cad135d3eeffdffb11fbcc28aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22170edbf4b18a850932715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才不会让出前方的风景…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9602ed5d9fb021357feb0044d7823bcdb3cb518b853df6c56d5954600cd88a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dc050c5b3cf7091e6c50fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\n晨练的话已经完成了哦……\n要进行追加训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94bba9011ffc504cc9acab2492058d13baa0d5995fbd77e5078645f2cb6abe4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e3124ddc4aa7ce14c1bde1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有好好吃午饭哦。\n不好好补充营养的话，\n会跑不动的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cf3b1da179c3f87ca3d8cbedfc8a963781d6ef558b4d47d3fc8c08f8686c138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b39e548b14475e8f5c63ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的训练准备已经完成了。\n要现在开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a5ab6a29dbb2c72b39a089db3edb570274774887ed9a226ac6e54df0960964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e7de1c412e14611c154312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "草地、沙土、马路……\n今天都跑了个遍呢，呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6efb04499dc590d0c43a90bac27189cdd9abab930aaafdb63493ebfc01a5c52e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3559b52aca84c0dc960cf572",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，已经这个时间了吗……？\n只要开始训练，时间总是过得很快啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7e007396fbc3f097add28d3e20ca9ef7419548d9884efefd681cd478de9084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc866cd02a377efdef3ba13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还是没跑够，\n所以决定跑着回宿舍。\n……虽然距离很短就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "288456cc1a0a2e908551f28caf1f14f4c5b43f754db7a4139a889085ab68d2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6907ad16d44fa6d847e4749",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有花瓣落在了头上……\n可我知道照镜子之前都没有注意到……\n好、好害羞……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65822f2bfc1e31c5798381176b736b6ef62046ae570e4d3e48e8badfbfee9fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dd9b8f009810c806742e9e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃黄瓜可以有效防止中暑，\n气槽是这么说的……\n那一天应该吃多少根呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b670d5b7a1a99a32117990642ed69aad93ba3df719cefea525400f69e9f859d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ce31ecdc87075feb6bbf51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在外面跑步的时候，\n看见有些人家已经在屋外挂起干柿子了。\n秋天……就是这种感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d37e52cef5c7cd0afe4dd47acf0940c8634fcffccc386485d4c4398a2267e3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99eecfe909425ee3b18b6eaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是水池结了冰得话，\n就可以在上面跑步了呢。\n……果然还是有些危险吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c2d145b7e9b16f18c0024ed0ac25f62a581d03fb9965c326502dc0a0450a9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1caea9053a9d434dc3756096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安──哈啾。\r\n早上穿着这身打扮……\r\n会感到些许寒意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5273f1fd3acefda3196300a39327612f47cec3d8a7ae30df87a53af59487b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f679f864474a02ae63ebadab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……\r\n早晨的风吹得脸颊好舒服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a99281b16f65a086587ae9ab699ea9395a67f225ccc774646d66faa27e4e224d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d48484832d6a21ada0448e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安。\r\n我随时可以开始\r\n进行泳池训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eea7c8f479aaf30bbb25812b2628e4959e099e5856de611252753d7cbf9a3a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fc6088d8036fd7475c7f180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐要在哪里吃好呢？\r\n偶尔在外面铺野餐巾吃也不错……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a98f2fe22fa2e03d3b48060d75ade14ddef0bd09fcee0554a8f79c689fb5060",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5370e0dd2a3656a0063797d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夕阳一转眼就西下了呢……\r\n就是因为这样，\r\n才会让人觉得美丽吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5e74cd500e5dc4271c7851a7250c2a9cd7d8680c26644bde391f1bd7e5844f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1186c0e2a762d80d80c37ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气槽说椰子油对消除疲劳很有效。\r\n只是我不晓得该怎么用……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db8e34cc17c792adceec9b50f55216c8b1cd77627c5c297e3a8c179fd56d251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b9fbed16dc7e6a03fd459f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伤、伤脑筋……每位新生\r\n都来问我游泳池在哪里……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c798f66acc2729d318e60abdcf016af2719c3914bf86929b2821ef012b2d98ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:825289b4eab3141b90ebeb4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好呢。\r\n感觉泡在水里会很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1492b61640dc803b47a6e6cc0b1ae05877fc8c4fbda5ce45d6cba2bb030f8bb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906dfda2caf2173973143acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节的西晒真是耀眼呢。\r\n我得记得擦防晒乳才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd7b844f056529fabe1b3d7de6415649efcc9e04495bfc6bc76c07962bd9e995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d273a9160373f7958807bf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的泳池是温水池，\r\n冬天真的帮了我们很大的忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "758d1398dcdb219e6d9704c93c98c16cbd0855d078ccbe72f8c38861862714f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb83301b981ceb7c88d83595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a08ad2b241c8e0cf4f7903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb8e37d453f50bec7999de6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树告诉了我短距离的诀窍……\n『Enjoy Spirits☆desu』\n……完全不明白她在说什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc701f1b943dcfe360703fdb976ac2cf2263da3ecded0528adf1f9e14316747f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c749c9aaee64ac33414f7f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "城市里到处都是高楼大厦……\n偶尔也想像小时候那样，\n在一片什么都没有的草原上奔跑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a9fbfce19b6c8d407d87f1d19b28394781b26fa430434a814eccdcce8deeae1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1491cab0104369c593af9e0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从福来那里拿到的护身符，\n要怎么处理呢……找不到能放那么大\n金色鲤鱼的地方……唔嗯嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c988c489dc0dbcad6af6ed4830cc2d4e3a3c12bf3c64000bffaa74683145c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf3c131e2d0db52daf57bf34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑道上的草一直都很漂亮呢……\n也必须要对那些整备人员心怀感激呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a780912a0663a1872cc83938a403fb44926b84241fe95c7136c22ee9688f569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:542f0c902732aa1b7a121bc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好天气能一直持续下去就好了……\n在雨里面跑的话很容易变冷，\n没法长时间奔跑呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91992f2ed2eb44846a741f2e98dd221ccf3a47299c75752527045d1f98e675f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f32162b8b97f181f700f9a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得小心别让肚子着凉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84372d49c1ee7769cc63095641b10986f7d5eca820668df7915dae5e75213b7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e6f93e5eb1f8176647945d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有胜者才能站上去的舞台，\n果然非常特别呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fac59bca136e3ccf86735bd0c2c3aa403e8d534865bf00a0cf3d0ad60fa9f8c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3340929c42a0154e7705bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这件衣服，\n身处前方、破风前行的感觉就会苏醒过来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c9b54541ac0a835f74f004f5289100f6b2d5710010f1c766c198e340b326c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0650450b3a3a48613067cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要、要怎么办呀……\n只要一穿上决胜服，\n就会变得想立马开始奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82a8a6bd3b0922ffcc8664db098789c0a8eaca3a2af00e371ea11b31e09f8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:debf36b47a5b2cf0f379b742",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把铃声换成鼓号曲的话\n起床之后心情就会特别好呢，呵呵呵。\n（鼓号曲：赛前宣布比赛开始的音乐）",
      "source_fingerprint": "51cc84aa5582f985d34218c876e040a1ce72c47abc912288bccb672ea343f3b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cab50a2d656c9dd3dcd2dbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和小特一起吃饭，\n不知不觉就会吃得特别多。\n该怎么办才好呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48059c6613f626099940ebbbf215aaab90e47f2c2670bf20d7f124d10341d78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fdd6c9b1f93016a88833f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在睡前闭上眼睛时，\n眼前就会浮现出\n以往奔跑时看见的风景……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26e6a41da469e8f269ff63091fc6d339a17753cfae348176bf657e0fc37bbead",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31e223ea72043c7780c901fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天有很多比赛，\n是我特别喜欢的季节呢！\n呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ece5abe1dca24e71aad883627bf85712eec2d203d0a0684dab1265af3be10c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa69de0926e2402ff1ee2ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条是晨间慢跑用，这条是下午训练用，这条是晚上跑步用……毛巾真的得多准备几根呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7a3e992036899a22eb818589a7ff39b689450dfc6bf4e1afc39fa9dcbdd790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f86c11ced6837eda38f6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来，前段时间的时候，\n衣服上沾了不少虫子。\n是因为在森林里跑得太久了吗…哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e274cd7164d115c66803ea5efa0f37970a764e5b33ac7d7b8494de6654abe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8992f271a848a59272cd1dd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着雪慢慢落下，有种幽静的美感呢。\n――啊，而且，\n在积雪上跑步也很有趣哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "833d6847041d4aa33ec9ae482f7af9bd7e66544707b727c3bf5ee2efe52b3098",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10951cebf2f98762e4c58412",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我做了、一个梦。\r\n我梦到采珠前辈\r\n在海边教我跳桑巴舞……",
      "source_fingerprint": "68ad97f0eebbbc014f9c8a26085be969474b6f01eb402599007991789cceaccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628e19b82d48a7c1df717151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南国的度假胜地也不错耶。\r\n虽然不会下雪让人有一点\r\n惋惜就是了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e34c2e418578558dbdfb51cf09ff9b32a93ea327db0de64d3a2c54806099676e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8191db0065b31e109a2668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树对我说：「你的泳装\r\n跟我的决胜服一模一样♪」\r\n好像真的是耶……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9f9099cbe54f7513903b59d891b302bce9be526cf7b6ecb6419ff70117780e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758fc289fab57f1cb0804306",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特说她「很擅长绑辫子」……\r\n所以要帮我绑头发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "776f8632fb7e18fe50b758237acaa265f3ef7d6a021766d4a5d72364aeaf994f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c2cc8f8d93cbd1942b61d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "福来说我今天的幸运食物是\r\n火龙果……要去哪里才买得到呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ded0605cab4f0151a3f57703ff0d2869815904c1262e717ddf88971facd2ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b9974a35aef9d50f1beb1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……海浪声实在太悦耳，\r\n不适合拿来当闹铃呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed8c658c5746cbed66e6cec131957c695a24bff22aaaeacd4401180c98b1613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb5e329cda2be7ef0d873b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真好……\r\n要不要来做个日光浴呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc18bf562e519a95749d8b88a023e819c7c21a7693391701f267bf36311a293",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d977a2f3b234400be2b4bb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将贝壳放在耳畔时所听到的声音……\r\n有股让人莫名静下心的魔力对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c65068149508fd7f11d4e86b4546dd796aaf45178256fbdc39c880d8eb40044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9218a076622a3f0e72947cf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……枝枒间洒落的阳光真美。\r\n都让我快要睡着了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b98c204d26e18a06d8e19752675858fead2bae276f250875d47fa5f7f0e7027",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94e387d87396da8e70e15ede",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像今天这种日子，\r\n到海边玩应该很开心吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9defbc6a25da7f8f400984e1eb2a4573348668240ca662a6bda8232fa69381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5debbeb526a6031540da50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我习惯凉爽的气候了。\r\n毕竟我是在雪国长大的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2687e7dffd15ebb3c233b88fdb26b694aad6b1cc5fefc7f19e442720d67f2475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c78360d6a0fa2fb740197508",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……不要紧。\r\n跑一跑就暖了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9f446ed056149a77025155ad7e0a8a6a3231c36715b418ae62142076d7ca7ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc63a0faf3464b02b65612c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说缅栀花的香味\r\n似乎有助于提升集中力。\r\n……感觉很适合在比赛前使用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d5f85c310ccb8a124ffeba343f86de32544a615695c8b05b1d28339e03265a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b47d0bc63924daaa1dbc58a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小小的珍珠真漂亮……\r\n就像白雪一样闪闪发光……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1033505fd2d1ef0936e29ed43808013b316c7a0ceae4202717d2648a95e7d4a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe701473b3f9731091acf699",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都在跑步哦。\n当然，接下来也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "974f73203d526e4f031b70afb5c14dc14fc3f56c6a5c276f93cdc6ddf399420f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2f34a154f18dbc756a2008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわ……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a27b65282aaa4aa8499e7a78d831aa344767394904e17e051c954f1f5d1ef9fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f6b0d0ca1abe2b7a89c103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天\n会在怎样的赛道上奔跑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18d66178d79a3e9e290622a423d219badb57f8ead35bd82fc2c01d56c55f9889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee1acfbb56a46083eeb37f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在奔跑这方面，我不会输给任何人。\n所以请安排严厉的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c1eb07a5997e4a1fda0bd2c6790a4e168146aa3c04bc19e4b33b6b998dc3c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7df1af0efdbfde548b1862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好舒服的风……\n跑起来的话，应该会更开心吧……\n呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40199227b1b7b1c5ae5d7888ff9770218579fb39fce616d09ad1ebb25b95cb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1181f09af811a916bb14e08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种实力在逐渐增强的感觉。\n……不好好珍惜这种感觉的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c588a1b1d981fde3b761ded77ce351214a2717119a7340b4d1bd744230cf029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579898eced541f28334cfc02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续这样成长下去的话，\n就感觉不管怎样的景色都能看见呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b4ce40e9818e2a9320a6c8b7cc67f3a8b720e528e38dbb12722384779da274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c7dc42f840554349de8c65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是因为一些微小的契机，\n双眼所见的景色也会变化……\n有种被这样教导了的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dac5c36c6a07abdf94412e4835053ecded1469f8dbe70e3ec7b1a62ee253137b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2a2541056df68c2c95282f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备已经完成了哦。\n要现在开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f468b5f7f560d61bd8eddcb1a573a3b56377dd22fb453ca40029cf071a4a9764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9366e75a2790747ac4d9a09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要跑到哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe868e9b2029b2a7775e55f310940bd343b3972e5f571c4d294b0d4ebc173db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76497821715867d1d08c3a63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一天，我会抵达水平线的彼端……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de41a17361ea769016d631e5b4d58e68b76a94fe707e561c8350629e87af1370",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d02f5ea3504254729ee1920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听得见风声。\r\n真舒服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a85d11c803827283780ed29c4451a11c64abdb4ae7510bf3c4018cd3f6c4324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df76fbcef5831f0129a3c6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我得把凉鞋的带子扣好才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9cfffeae62530ac1d367b2b80cbe85ecbc6647cfcb3c38208f0175dc67e40b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a991da0a4bc9ac49b475ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……有什么令你在意的地方吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f29396104eaa94f88a6b8b2d40776332811e96622fdf31517b128344ef1a390a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efdddbbe66b3c22baccc5d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔找个地方放松一下……\r\n或许也是个不错的选择呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f713ff2ee1cd062d4ab75f1d071d22b58c07f468ae29252245d70a38d34f8195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c52daec46808d4ad2f7afdf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后我也想继续和你\r\n一起去看许许多多的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb1ef738b08c6c0d1642957352faa4f10262dbcc0ab4bf9a6d7b1ad27cc046dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "92022"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
